Bob Bellows: Good mornin' Cap'n. [ID:bob 2.1]
You: Morning! Nice weather today isn't it? 
Bob Bellows: I suppose. Not as nice as back home though. [ID:bob 2.2]
You: You miss it, don't you.
Bob Bellows: Every day. [ID:bob 2.3]
You: Do you miss it enough to leave? By force if you have to?
Bob Bellows: I'm not the one causing that mutiny if that's what you're getting at. I ain't that desperate. Not yet. [ID:bob 2.4]
- Is there anyone you think might be?
	You: Is there anyone you think might be?
	Bob Bellows: Marley would be my guess. Never trusted him. [ID:bob 2.5.1]
- I'm sorry you're feeling so down.
	You: I'm sorry you're feeling so down.
